@startuml
' Partida del modo Historieta, de punta a punta.
' Fuente: modules/story-game, language-review, story-media y story-history.
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12

actor "Jugadores" as Players
participant "LP-MOB" as Mobile
participant "StoryGameGateway\n(/story)" as Gateway
participant "StoryGameService" as Service
database "Redis\n(story:{gameId})" as Redis
participant "LanguageReviewService" as Review
queue "BullMQ\nstory-media" as MediaQueue
participant "StoryMediaService" as Media
participant "Servicios externos\n(Bedrock, Polly,\nCloudflare, S3)" as Ext
participant "StoryHistoryService" as History
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Lobby ==
Players -> Mobile: Crear historieta o unirse con código
Mobile -> Gateway: createStoryGame / joinStoryGame
Gateway -> Service: crear o unir (lock + script Lua)
Service -> Redis: estado de la partida
Gateway --> Mobile: lobbyUpdated (a la sala)
Players -> Mobile: Configurar y empezar (anfitrión)
Mobile -> Gateway: updateConfig / startStory

== Turnos (una viñeta por turno) ==
loop por cada viñeta
  Gateway --> Mobile: turnStarted (autor, turnEndsAt)
  Players -> Mobile: Texto, escenario y personajes
  Mobile -> Gateway: submitPanelDraft
  Gateway -> Review: revisar borrador (nivel del jugador)
  Review -> Ext: Bedrock Converse (Nova 2 Lite)
  Ext --> Review: correcciones
  Gateway --> Mobile: panelReviewResult al autor /\npanelDraftReviewed a los demás
  Mobile -> Gateway: confirmPanel
  Service -> Redis: viñeta cerrada + puntaje
  Gateway --> Mobile: panelConfirmed
  note over Service: Si vence el tiempo, la cola story-turn-timeout\ncierra el turno con el último borrador.
end

== Generación de media (PROCESSING) ==
Service -> MediaQueue: panel-audio y panel-image por viñeta
Gateway --> Mobile: storyProcessing (avance)
MediaQueue -> Media: generateAudio / generateImage
Media -> Ext: Polly (audio + speech marks)\nCloudflare Workers AI (imagen, 5 intentos)
Media -> Ext: S3 PutObject
Media -> Service: onPanelAudio / onPanelImage
Service -> Ext: Bedrock: título de la historieta
Gateway --> Mobile: panelMediaReady (URLs firmadas)

== Review y cierre ==
Gateway --> Mobile: storyReviewReady (manifiesto)
Mobile --> Players: Review narrado viñeta por viñeta
opt reacciones
  Mobile -> Gateway: reactToPanel(order, emoji)
  Gateway --> Mobile: panelReaction (a la sala)
end
Service -> Redis: FINISHED (TTL 1 h)
Service -> History: evento story.finished
History -> DB: story, story_panel, story_participant\n(una transacción)

@enduml
